active","historicity":"historical_tradition","identity_note":"固定魏書058本單元敘事角色；未名者不補名、未明世代不補父母，不接遠祖。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAD","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010","quote":"建義元年，遷司徒公。尒朱榮東討葛榮，詔椿統眾為後軍，榮擒葛榮，乃止。永安初，進位太保、侍中，給後部鼓吹。元顥入洛，椿子征東將軍昱出鎮滎陽，為顥所擒。又椿弟順為冀州刺史，順子仲宣正平太守，兄子侃、弟子遁並從駕河北，為顥嫌疑。以椿家世顯重，恐失人望，未及加罪。時人助其憂怖，或有勸椿攜家避禍。椿曰：「吾內外百口，何處逃竄？正當坐任運耳。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010:m0086","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010:m0084"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-zhongxuan-father-shun","interpretation_note":"按本源明文或完整相鄰子附敘配局部父子；不把兄弟都補父、不接未名世代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}},{"id":"fum_370_iq6_AAADBA","aliases":[{"surface":"玄就","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031:m0003"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031:m0003","quote":"玄就"}],"label":"玄就〔楊仲宣子〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","identity_note":"固定魏書058本單元敘事角色；未名者不補名、未明世代不補父母，不接遠祖。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAADB","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031","quote":"仲宣子玄就，幼而俊拔。收捕時年九歲，牽挽兵人，謂曰：「欲害諸尊，乞先就死。」兵人以刀斫斷其臂，猶請死不止，遂先殺之。永熙初，贈汝陰太守。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058