":false,"model":null,"note":"原人物錨只稱玄就；姓楊為同源原全文名及逐步明名兄弟／父子的有資格編輯首選，拼合全名不是原quote，不生成共同父或新親屬。","surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_bounded_named_family_path","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"完整本單元已讀，按有限明名近系承接姓氏；兄弟不動世代，明父子才加一，不把兄弟轉成父子或以ID補姓。","source_name_record_id":"name-weishu058-yangchun-exact","source_full_quote":"北都時，朝法嚴急。太和初，吾兄弟三人並居內職，兄在高祖左右，吾與津在文明太后左右。于時口敕，責諸內官，十日仰密得一事，不列便大瞋嫌。諸人多有依敕密列者，亦有太后、高祖中間傳言構間者。吾兄弟自相誡曰：「今忝二聖近臣，母子間甚難，宜深慎之。又列人事，亦何容易，縱被瞋責，慎勿輕言。」十餘年中，不嘗言一人罪過，當時大被嫌責。答曰：「臣等非不聞人言，正恐不審，仰誤聖聽，是以不敢言。」於後終以不言蒙賞。及二聖間言語，終不敢輒爾傳通。太和二十一年，吾從濟州來朝，在清徽堂豫讌。高祖謂諸王、諸貴曰：「北京之日，太后嚴明，吾每得杖，左右因此有是非言語。和朕母子者唯楊椿兄弟。」遂舉賜四兄及我酒。汝等脫若萬一蒙時主知遇，宜深慎言語，不可輕論人惡也。","seed_frame":{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p014","paragraph_sha256":"b339c5134376f2d4d93dc8504cb8f2bba7c96a633f8170e7e1cab0a5434282fe","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"},"steps":[{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-ying-brother-chun","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAB","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAC","traversal":"older_to_younger","generation_before":0,"generation_after":0,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p026","quote":"椿弟穎，字惠哲。本州別駕。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p026:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p026:m0000"}],"source_frames":[{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p026","paragraph_sha256":"7d515265c80e0dbcb10392123e1c21d57cbda3cbb2827ddb935e5aaff23476d7","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}]},{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-shun-brother-ying","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAC","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAD","traversal":"older_to_younger","generation_before":0,"generation_after":0,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p028","quote":"穎弟順，字延和，寬裕謹厚。太和中，起家奉朝請。累遷直閤將軍、北中郎將、兼武衞將軍、太僕卿。預立莊帝之功，封三門縣開國公，食邑七百戶。出為平北將軍、冀州刺史，尋進號撫軍將軍。罷州還，遇害，年六十五。太昌初，贈都督相殷二州諸軍事、太尉公、錄尚書事、相州刺史。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p028:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p028:m0000"}],"source_frames":[{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p028","paragraph_sha256":"967dcd1bd6ec39dd03755b16c2284b6ae0075a199b281a529972d606c5a2917c","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}]},{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-zhongxuan-father-shun","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAD","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAADB","traversal":"father_to_child","generation_before":0,"generation_after":1,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010","quote":"建義元年，遷司徒公。尒朱榮東討葛榮，詔椿統眾為後軍，榮擒葛榮，乃止。永安初，進位太保、侍中，給後部鼓吹。元顥入洛，椿子征東將軍昱出鎮滎陽，為顥所擒。又椿弟順為冀州刺史，順子仲宣正平太守，兄子侃、弟子遁並從駕河北，為顥嫌疑。以椿家世顯重，恐失人望，未及加罪。時人助其憂怖，或有勸椿攜家避禍。椿曰：「吾內外百口，何處逃竄？正當坐任運耳。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010:m0086","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010:m0084"}],"source_frames":[{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p010","paragraph_sha256":"50be28515f0c67f6a6a4b70ebd77b20b300e5178fbed70440a07461d304bf50e","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}]},{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-xuanjiu-father-zhongxuan","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAADB","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAADBA","traversal":"father_to_child","generation_before":1,"generation_after":2,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031","quote":"仲宣子玄就，幼而俊拔。收捕時年九歲，牽挽兵人，謂曰：「欲害諸尊，乞先就死。」兵人以刀斫斷其臂，猶請死不止，遂先殺之。永熙初，贈汝陰太守。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031:m0000"}],"source_frames":[{"paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p031","paragraph_sha256":"3c23b2eccb0094b691fc7e2b73b21affcc46b3b47929c1e8d054cb1b85bbd3fa","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}]}]},"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998"}]}
